   ],
   "start_s": 214.973,
   "end_s": 219.497,
   "text": "whose household drank it mixed with twenty parts of water to one."
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-075",
   "scene": "S31",
   "image": "S31_v2.png",
   "move": "crop_close",
   "crop_rect": [
    520,
    440,
    1000,
    563
   ],
   "start_s": 219.497,
   "end_s": 223.681,
   "text": "The giant drinks three bowls, and Homer counts them."
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-076",
   "scene": "S31",
   "image": "S31_base.png",
   "move": "hold",
   "crop_rect": null,
   "start_s": 223.681,
   "end_s": 225.769,
   "text": "Then he asks the guest's name,"
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-077",
   "scene": "S31",
   "image": "S31_v1.png",
   "move": "variant",
   "crop_rect": null,
   "start_s": 225.769,
   "end_s": 227.493,
   "text": "and promises a present."
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-078",
   "scene": "S32",
   "image": "S32_base.png",
   "move": "crop_close",
   "crop_rect": [
    250,
    560,
    440,
    248
   ],
   "start_s": 227.493,
   "end_s": 230.413,
   "text": "Odysseus tells him his name is Nobody."
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-079",
   "scene": "S32",
   "image": "S32_v1.png",
   "move": "variant",
   "crop_rect": null,
   "start_s": 230.413,
   "end_s": 234.668,
   "text": "The giant laughs and says that his present will be this:"
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-080",
   "scene": "S32",
   "image": "S32_v2.png",
   "move": "variant",
   "crop_rect": null,
   "start_s": 234.668,
   "end_s": 236.798,
   "text": "he will eat Nobody last."
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-081",
   "scene": "S33",
   "image": "S33_base.png",
   "move": "hold",
   "crop_rect": null,
   "start_s": 236.798,
   "end_s": 242.518,
   "text": "A name like that is a joke, and the giant is the only one who does not hear it."
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-084",
   "scene": "S33",
   "image": "S33_v1.png",
   "move": "variant",
   "crop_rect": null,
   "start_s": 242.518,
   "end_s": 246.61,
   "text": "It is a small trick, and the whole escape will hang on it."
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-085",
   "scene": "S34",
   "image": "S34_base.png",
   "move": "hold",
   "crop_rect": null,
   "start_s": 246.61,
   "end_s": 248.397,
   "text": "The giant sinks to the floor"
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-086",
   "scene": "S34",
   "image": "S34_base.png",
   "move": "crop_close",
   "crop_rect": [
    300,
    520,
    600,
    338
   ],
   "start_s": 248.397,
   "end_s": 249.877,
   "text": "and passes out."
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-087",
   "scene": "S34",
   "image": "S34_base.png",
   "move": "crop_close",
   "crop_rect": [
    1000,
    380,
    520,
    293
   ],
   "start_s": 249.877,
   "end_s": 254.782,
   "text": "Odysseus looks at the sleeping giant, then at his men, and nods."
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-088",
   "scene": "S35",
   "image": "S35_base.png",
   "move": "hold",
   "crop_rect": null,
   "start_s": 254.782,
   "end_s": 257.613,
   "text": "Odysseus pushes the stake into the fire"
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-089",
   "scene": "S35",
   "image": "S35_base.png",
   "move": "crop_close",
   "crop_rect": [
    560,
    560,
    500,
    281
   ],
   "start_s": 257.613,
   "end_s": 260.676,
   "text": "and holds it there until the point glows."
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-090",
   "scene": "S35",
   "image": "S35_base.png",
   "move": "crop_close",
   "crop_rect": [
    430,
    380,
    760,
    428
   ],
   "start_s": 260.676,
   "end_s": 263.659,
   "text": "No one speaks, because no one needs to."
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-091",
   "scene": "S36",
   "image": "S36_base.png",
   "move": "hold",
   "crop_rect": null,
   "start_s": 263.659,
   "end_s": 265.936,
   "text": "Then he and four men lift it"
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-092",
   "scene": "S36",
   "image": "S36_v1.png",
   "move": "variant",
   "crop_rect": null,
   "start_s": 265.936,
   "end_s": 268.322,
   "text": "and put it in the giant's eye."
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-093",
   "scene": "S36",
   "image": "S36_v2.png",
   "move": "variant",
   "crop_rect": null,
   "start_s": 268.322,
   "end_s": 271.777,
   "text": "The cave fills with a sound that is not quite a roar."
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-094",
   "scene": "S37",
   "image": "S37_base.png",
   "move": "hold",
   "crop_rect": null,
   "start_s": 271.777,
   "end_s": 274.9,
   "text": "Homer reaches for a blacksmith's simile:"
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-095",
   "scene": "S37",
   "image": "S37_v1.png",
   "move": "variant",
   "crop_rect": null,
   "start_s": 274.9,
   "end_s": 278.79,
   "text": "an axe plunged into cold water, hissing."
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-096",
   "scene": "S38",
   "image": "S38_base.png",
   "move": "hold",
   "crop_rect": null,
   "start_s": 278.79,
   "end_s": 282.288,
   "text": "The giant's scream brings his neighbours to the cave."
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-097",
   "scene": "S38",
   "image": "S38_v1.png",
   "move": "variant",
   "crop_rect": null,
   "start_s": 282.288,
   "end_s": 284.766,
   "text": "They ask if someone is killing him."
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-098",
   "scene": "S39",
   "image": "S39_base.png",
   "move": "hold",
   "crop_rect": null,
   "start_s": 284.766,
   "end_s": 289.999,
   "text": "He shouts back that Nobody is killing him, by trickery and not by force."
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-099",
   "scene": "S40",
   "image": "S40_base.png",
   "move": "hold",
   "crop_rect": null,
   "start_s": 289.999,
   "end_s": 293.25,
   "text": "The neighbours reply that if nobody is hurting him,"
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-100",
   "scene": "S40",
   "image": "S40_v1.png",
   "move": "variant",
   "crop_rect": null,
   "start_s": 293.25,
   "end_s": 296.042,
   "text": "it must be a sickness from Zeus."
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-101",
   "scene": "S40",
   "image": "S40_v2.png",
   "move": "variant",
   "crop_rect": null,
   "start_s": 296.042,
   "end_s": 299.266,
   "text": "He should pray to his father and let them sleep."
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-102",
   "scene": "S41",
   "image": "S41_base.png",
   "move": "crop_close",
   "crop_rect": [
    120,
    620,
    520,
    293
   ],
   "start_s": 299.266,
   "end_s": 302.487,
   "text": "They go home, and the trick has worked."
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-103",
   "scene": "S41",
   "image": "S41_base.png",
   "move": "hold",
   "crop_rect": null,
   "start_s": 302.487,
   "end_s": 306.927,
   "text": "The giant has lost his eye, but he has not lost his strength,"
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-104",
   "scene": "S41",
   "image": "S41_v1.png",
   "move": "variant",
   "crop_rect": null,
   "start_s": 306.927,
   "end_s": 311.065,
   "text": "and the stone still waits at the door."
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-105",
   "scene": "S42",
   "image": "S42_base.png",
   "move": "hold",
   "crop_rect": null,
   "start_s": 311.065,
   "end_s": 313.516,
   "text": "At dawn the sheep file out,"
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-106",
   "scene": "S42",
   "image": "S42_v1.png",
   "move": "variant",
   "crop_rect": null,
   "start_s": 313.516,
   "end_s": 317.507,
   "text": "and the blind giant sits in the doorway with his hands out."
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-107",
   "scene": "S42",
   "image": "S42_v1.png",
   "move": "crop_close",
   "crop_rect": [
    300,
    280,
    1000,
    563
   ],
   "start_s": 317.507,
   "end_s": 321.918,
   "text": "The flock is all he can still count, and he counts it by touch."
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-108",
   "scene": "S43",
   "image": "S43_base.png",
   "move": "crop_close",
   "crop_rect": [
    60,
    600,
    720,
    405
   ],
   "start_s": 321.918,
   "end_s": 324.321,
   "text": "Odysseus has tied the sheep in threes,"
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-109",
   "scene": "S43",
   "image": "S43_v3.png",
   "move": "variant",
   "crop_rect": null,
   "start_s": 324.321,
   "end_s": 327.16,
   "text": "with a man hanging under each middle one."
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-110",
   "scene": "S43",
   "image": "S43_base.png",
   "move": "crop_close",
   "crop_rect": [
    700,
    330,
    760,
    428
   ],
   "start_s": 327.16,
   "end_s": 329.68,
   "text": "He saves the best ram for himself,"
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-111",
   "scene": "S43",
   "image": "S43_v2.png",
   "move": "variant",
   "crop_rect": null,
   "start_s": 329.68,
   "end_s": 331.868,
   "text": "and clings to its belly."
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-112",
   "scene": "S44",
   "image": "S44_base.png",
   "move": "crop_close",
   "crop_rect": [
    820,
    540,
    700,
    394
   ],
   "start_s": 331.868,
   "end_s": 335.398,
   "text": "The giant feels along their backs as they pass,"
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-113",
   "scene": "S44",
   "image": "S44_base.png",
   "move": "pull_out",
   "crop_rect": null,
   "push": {
    "from": 1.06,
    "to": 1
   },
   "start_s": 335.398,
   "end_s": 337.214,
   "text": "but never their bellies."
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-115",
   "scene": "S44",
   "image": "S44_base.png",
   "move": "crop_close",
   "crop_rect": [
    600,
    640,
    500,
    281
   ],
   "start_s": 337.214,
   "end_s": 342.873,
   "text": "Every sheep is a risk. If one man slips, or one animal bleats,"
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-116",
   "scene": "S44",
   "image": "S44_v1.png",
   "move": "variant",
   "crop_rect": null,
   "start_s": 342.873,
   "end_s": 346.994,
   "text": "the plan ends in the dark, with a very large hand."
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-117",
   "scene": "S45",
   "image": "S45_base.png",
   "move": "hold",
   "crop_rect": null,
   "start_s": 346.994,
   "end_s": 350.944,
   "text": "Last of all comes the ram that carries Odysseus."
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-118",
   "scene": "S45",
   "image": "S45_v1.png",
   "move": "variant",
   "crop_rect": null,
   "start_s": 350.944,
   "end_s": 353.427,
   "text": "And the giant speaks to it tenderly:"
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-119",
   "scene": "S45",
   "image": "S45_v2.png",
   "move": "variant",
   "crop_rect": null,
   "start_s": 353.427,
   "end_s": 357.317,
   "text": "\"My good ram… you lag last of all."
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-120",
   "scene": "S45",
   "image": "S45_v2.png",
   "move": "crop_close",
   "crop_rect": [
    700,
    520,
    640,
    360
   ],
   "start_s": 357.317,
   "end_s": 361.072,
   "text": "Is it because you know your master has lost his eye?\""
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-121",
   "scene": "S46",
   "image": "S46_base.png",
   "move": "hold",
   "crop_rect": null,
   "start_s": 361.072,
   "end_s": 364.474,
   "text": "It is the gentlest moment the giant has in the poem,"
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-122",
   "scene": "S46",
   "image": "S46_base.png",
   "move": "crop_close",
   "crop_rect": [
    1000,
    560,
    500,
    281
   ],
   "start_s": 364.474,
   "end_s": 366.708,
   "text": "and it is aimed at a ram."
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-123",
   "scene": "S46",
   "image": "S46_v1.png",
   "move": "variant",
   "crop_rect": null,
   "start_s": 366.708,
   "end_s": 368.608,
   "text": "Then he lets it go."
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-124",
   "scene": "S46",
   "image": "S46_v2.png",
   "move": "variant",
   "crop_rect": null,
   "start_s": 368.608,
   "end_s": 373.399,
   "text": "He does not know that he has just let his whole victory walk out of the door."
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-125",
   "scene": "S47",
   "image": "S47_base.png",
   "move": "hold",
   "crop_rect": null,
   "start_s": 373.399,
   "end_s": 376.325,
   "text": "Outside, the men drop from the sheep"
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-126",
   "scene": "S47",
   "image": "S47_v1.png",
   "move": "pan_right",
   "crop_rect": null,
   "push": {
    "translate_pct": 4
   },
   "start_s": 376.325,
   "end_s": 380.024,
   "text": "and drive the whole flock down to the ship."
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-127",
   "scene": "S48",
   "image": "S48_base.png",
   "move": "hold",
   "crop_rect": null,
   "start_s": 380.024,
   "end_s": 382.485,
   "text": "Odysseus should sail away quietly,"
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-128",
   "scene": "S48",
   "image": "S48_base.png",
   "move": "crop_close",
   "crop_rect": [
    1000,
    250,
    520,
    293
   ],
   "start_s": 382.485,
   "end_s": 384.046,
   "text": "now that he has won."
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-129",
   "scene": "S48",
   "image": "S48_v1.png",
   "move": "variant",
   "crop_rect": null,
   "start_s": 384.046,
   "end_s": 388.536,
   "text": "Instead, he stands on the deck and jeers at the giant."
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-131",
   "scene": "S48",
   "image": "S48_base.png",
   "move": "crop_close",
   "crop_rect": [
    1000,
    250,
    520,
    293
   ],
   "start_s": 388.536,
   "end_s": 393.807,
   "text": "It is the one mistake in the whole plan, and it is a mistake of pride."
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-132",
   "scene": "S49",
   "image": "S49_base.png",
   "move": "hold",
   "crop_rect": null,
   "start_s": 393.807,
   "end_s": 397.762,
   "text": "The giant tears the top off a mountain and throws it."
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-133",
   "scene": "S49",
   "image": "S49_v1.png",
   "move": "variant",
   "crop_rect": null,
   "start_s": 397.762,
   "end_s": 400.061,
   "text": "It lands just in front of the ship,"
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-134",
   "scene": "S49",
   "image": "S49_v2.png",
   "move": "variant",
   "crop_rect": null,
   "start_s": 400.061,
   "end_s": 403.236,
   "text": "and the wave sweeps them back toward the shore."
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-135",
   "scene": "S50",
   "image": "S50_base.png",
   "move": "crop_close",
   "crop_rect": [
    900,
    380,
    520,
    293
   ],
   "start_s": 403.236,
   "end_s": 405.047,
   "text": "The crew begs him to stop,"
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-136",
   "scene": "S50",
   "image": "S50_v1.png",
   "move": "variant",
   "crop_rect": null,
   "start_s": 405.047,
   "end_s": 408.55,
   "text": "because the giant has already thrown one rock at them."
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-137",
   "scene": "S50",
   "image": "S50_base.png",
   "move": "crop_close",
   "crop_rect": [
    1050,
    330,
    480,
    270
   ],
   "start_s": 408.55,
   "end_s": 413.083,
   "text": "But Odysseus shouts once more, and this time he gives his name."
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-138",
   "scene": "S50",
   "image": "S50_base.png",
   "move": "crop_close",
   "crop_rect": [
    1100,
    360,
    400,
    225
   ],
   "start_s": 413.083,
   "end_s": 415.266,
   "text": "If anyone asks who blinded you,"
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-139",
   "scene": "S50",
   "image": "S50_base.png",
   "move": "pull_out",
   "crop_rect": null,
   "push": {
    "from": 1.06,
    "to": 1
   },
   "start_s": 415.266,
   "end_s": 419.66,
   "text": "tell them it was Odysseus, son of Laertes, of Ithaca."
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-140",
   "scene": "S51",
   "image": "S51_base.png",
   "move": "crop_close",
   "crop_rect": [
    270,
    330,
    560,
    315
   ],
   "start_s": 419.66,
   "end_s": 421.43,
   "text": "So much for Nobody."
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-142",
   "scene": "S51",
   "image": "S51_base.png",
   "move": "hold",
   "crop_rect": null,
   "start_s": 421.43,
   "end_s": 425.264,
   "text": "The giant answers that a prophet named Telemus once warned him"
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-143",
   "scene": "S51",
   "image": "S51_v1.png",
   "move": "variant",
   "crop_rect": null,
   "start_s": 425.264,
   "end_s": 427.696,
   "text": "that Odysseus would take his eye."
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-144",
   "scene": "S51",
   "image": "S51_v2.png",
   "move": "variant",
   "crop_rect": null,
   "start_s": 427.696,
   "end_s": 430.354,
   "text": "He had expected a great warrior,"
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-145",
   "scene": "S51",
   "image": "S51_v3.png",
   "move": "variant",
   "crop_rect": null,
   "start_s": 430.354,
   "end_s": 434.578,
   "text": "and instead he got \"a little insignificant weakling.\""
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-146",
   "scene": "S51",
   "image": "S51_v4.png",
   "move": "variant",
   "crop_rect": null,
   "start_s": 434.578,
   "end_s": 437.457,
   "text": "He offers presents if Odysseus will come back,"
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-147",
   "scene": "S52",
   "image": "S52_base.png",
   "move": "hold",
   "crop_rect": null,
   "start_s": 437.457,
   "end_s": 441.234,
   "text": "and Odysseus answers that it will take more than Poseidon"
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-148",
   "scene": "S52",
   "image": "S52_base.png",
   "move": "crop_close",
   "crop_rect": [
    1050,
    300,
    480,
    270
   ],
   "start_s": 441.234,
   "end_s": 443.05,
   "text": "to cure that eye."
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-149",
   "scene": "S53",
   "image": "S53_base.png",
   "move": "hold",
   "crop_rect": null,
   "start_s": 443.05,
   "end_s": 446.171,
   "text": "Then the giant lifts both hands toward the sky,"
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-150",
   "scene": "S53",
   "image": "S53_base.png",
   "move": "crop_close",
   "crop_rect": [
    300,
    120,
    640,
    360
   ],
   "start_s": 446.171,
   "end_s": 448.254,
   "text": "and prays to Poseidon."
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-151",
   "scene": "S53",
   "image": "S53_v1.png",
   "move": "variant",
   "crop_rect": null,
   "start_s": 448.254,
   "end_s": 451.835,
   "text": "Never let Odysseus reach his home, he asks."
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-152",
   "scene": "S53",
   "image": "S53_v1.png",
   "move": "pull_out",
   "crop_rect": null,
   "push": {
    "from": 1.06,
    "to": 1
   },
   "start_s": 451.835,
   "end_s": 455.986,
   "text": "Or if he must, let him come \"late and in sore plight,"
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-153",
   "scene": "S54",
   "image": "S54_base.png",
   "move": "hold",
   "crop_rect": null,
   "start_s": 455.986,
   "end_s": 458.571,
   "text": "after losing all his men.\""
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-154",
   "scene": "S54",
   "image": "S54_v1.png",
   "move": "variant",
   "crop_rect": null,
   "start_s": 458.571,
   "end_s": 460.336,
   "text": "Poseidon listens."
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-155",
   "scene": "S55",
   "image": "S55_v1.png",
   "move": "variant",
   "crop_rect": null,
   "start_s": 460.336,
   "end_s": 464.82,
   "text": "The prayer is answered, and the rest of the Odyssey is the answer."
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-156",
   "scene": "S55",
   "image": "S55_v1.png",
   "move": "pull_out",
   "crop_rect": null,
   "push": {
    "from": 1.06,
    "to": 1
   },
   "start_s": 464.82,
   "end_s": 469.015,
   "text": "It will be years before Odysseus sees Ithaca again."
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-157",
   "scene": "S56",
   "image": "S56_base.png",
   "move": "hold",
   "crop_rect": null,
   "start_s": 469.015,
   "end_s": 471.656,
   "text": "Homer never actually says one eye."
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-158",
   "scene": "S56",
   "image": "S56_base.png",
   "move": "crop_close",
   "crop_rect": [
    850,
    470,
    440,
    248
   ],
   "start_s": 471.656,
   "end_s": 475.72,
   "text": "He says \"the eye,\" and takes the rest for granted."
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-159",
   "scene": "S57",
   "image": "S57_base.png",
   "move": "hold",
   "crop_rect": null,
   "start_s": 475.72,
   "end_s": 480.62,
   "text": "For the one eye, you need Hesiod, around seven hundred B.C."
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-160",
   "scene": "S58",
   "image": "S58_base.png",
   "move": "hold",
   "crop_rect": null,
   "start_s": 480.62,
   "end_s": 485.317,
   "text": "He has three Cyclopes at a forge, making the thunderbolt for Zeus."
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-161",
   "scene": "S58",
   "image": "S58_base.png",
   "move": "crop_close",
   "crop_rect": [
    420,
    380,
    600,
    338
   ],
   "start_s": 485.317,
   "end_s": 489.4,
   "text": "So one idea is that the Cyclopes began as smiths."
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-162",
   "scene": "S59",
   "image": "S59_base.png",
   "move": "hold",
   "crop_rect": null,
   "start_s": 489.4,
   "end_s": 494.853,
   "text": "In 1914, a palaeontologist named Othenio Abel imagined sailors"
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-163",
   "scene": "S60",
   "image": "S60_base.png",
   "move": "hold",
   "crop_rect": null,
   "start_s": 494.853,
   "end_s": 499.984,
   "text": "lighting a fire in a beach cave and seeing an elephant skull in the clay."
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-164",
   "scene": "S60",
   "image": "S60_v1.png",
   "move": "variant",
   "crop_rect": null,
   "start_s": 499.984,
   "end_s": 503.38,
   "text": "Abel thought it might be where the Cyclops came from."
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-165",
   "scene": "S61",
   "image": "S61_base.png",
   "move": "hold",
   "crop_rect": null,
   "start_s": 503.38,
   "end_s": 511.133,
   "text": "Ice Age Sicily had dwarf elephants. Head on, their skulls show one great hole in the middle,"
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-166",
   "scene": "S61",
   "image": "S61_v1.png",
   "move": "variant",
   "crop_rect": null,
   "start_s": 511.133,
   "end_s": 513.577,
   "text": "which is really the nasal cavity."
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-167",
   "scene": "S61",
   "image": "S61_v2.png",
   "move": "variant",
   "crop_rect": null,
   "start_s": 513.577,
   "end_s": 515.62,
   "text": "But Abel's sailors are imagined,"
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-168",
   "scene": "S62",
   "image": "S62_base.png",
   "move": "hold",
   "crop_rect": null,
   "start_s": 515.62,
   "end_s": 519.293,
   "text": "and it is a modern claim, not ancient evidence."
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-169",
   "scene": "S63",
   "image": "S63_base.png",
   "move": "hold",
   "crop_rect": null,
   "start_s": 519.293,
   "end_s": 521.437,
   "text": "Then there are the walls."
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-170",
   "scene": "S63",
   "image": "S63_v1.png",
   "move": "variant",
   "crop_rect": null,
   "start_s": 521.437,
   "end_s": 524.319,
   "text": "At Tiryns, the traveller Pausanias wrote"
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-171",
   "scene": "S63",
   "image": "S63_v2.png",
   "move": "variant",
   "crop_rect": null,
   "start_s": 524.319,
   "end_s": 528.084,
   "text": "that a pair of mules could not move even the smallest stone,"
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-172",
   "scene": "S63",
   "image": "S63_v3.png",
   "move": "variant",
   "crop_rect": null,
   "start_s": 528.084,
   "end_s": 530.272,
   "text": "and that the Cyclopes built it."
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-173",
   "scene": "S64",
   "image": "S64_v2.png",
   "move": "push_in",
   "crop_rect": null,
   "push": {
    "from": 1,
    "to": 1.06
   },
   "start_s": 530.272,
   "end_s": 534.032,
   "text": "People built those walls, around twelve fifty B.C.,"
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-174",
   "scene": "S64",
   "image": "S64_v1.png",
   "move": "variant",
   "crop_rect": null,
   "start_s": 534.032,
   "end_s": 537.729,
   "text": "though archaeologists still call the style cyclopean."
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-175",
   "scene": "S65",
   "image": "S65_base.png",
   "move": "hold",
   "crop_rect": null,
   "start_s": 537.729,
   "end_s": 541.024,
   "text": "In 1904, the scholar Oskar Hackman"
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-176",
   "scene": "S65",
   "image": "S65_v1.png",
   "move": "variant",
   "crop_rect": null,
   "start_s": 541.024,
   "end_s": 545.374,
   "text": "catalogued two hundred and twenty-one versions of one tale."
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-177",
   "scene": "S66",
   "image": "S66_base.png",
   "move": "hold",
   "crop_rect": null,
   "start_s": 545.374,
   "end_s": 550.119,
   "text": "In it, a man trapped by a giant blinds him and escapes."
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-178",
   "scene": "S67",
   "image": "S67_base.png",
   "move": "hold",
   "crop_rect": null,
   "start_s": 550.119,
   "end_s": 553.01,
   "text": "They come from Iceland, Portugal and Russia,"
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-179",
   "scene": "S67",
   "image": "S67_base.png",
   "move": "crop_close",
   "crop_rect": [
    830,
    620,
    700,
    394
   ],
   "start_s": 553.01,
   "end_s": 555.56,
   "text": "and even from the Arabian Nights."
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-180",
   "scene": "S68",
   "image": "S68_base.png",
   "move": "hold",
   "crop_rect": null,
   "start_s": 555.56,
   "end_s": 558.746,
   "text": "Many scholars think that tale is older than Homer."
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-181",
   "scene": "S68",
   "image": "S68_v1.png",
   "move": "variant",
   "crop_rect": null,
   "start_s": 558.746,
   "end_s": 560.737,
   "text": "None of them can be proved."
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-182",
   "scene": "S69",
   "image": "S69_base.png",
   "move": "crop_close",
   "crop_rect": [
    900,
    520,
    420,
    236
   ],
   "start_s": 560.737,
   "end_s": 563.953,
   "text": "Ask who can prove where the Cyclops came from,"
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-183",
   "scene": "S69",
   "image": "S69_base.png",
   "move": "pull_out",
   "crop_rect": null,
   "push": {
    "from": 1.06,
    "to": 1
   },
   "start_s": 563.953,
   "end_s": 567.643,
   "text": "and the honest answer is the one Odysseus gave him."
  },
  {
   "beat": "V5-184",
   "scene": "S70",
   "image": "S70_base.png",
   "move": "hold",
   "crop_rect": null,
   "start_s": 567.643,
   "end_s": 570.537,
   "text": "Nobody."
  }
 ]
}